/* =============================================================================
   scrSubmissions -> OnVisible   (screen property: paste into the formula bar)

   Same access rule as scrOverview: admins see everyone, line managers their
   reportees only, anyone else sees a no-access panel. This screen must not
   assume scrOverview was visited first, so it re-checks.
   The data build is btnRefreshSubs.OnSelect - identical to
   btnRefreshOverview.OnSelect on scrOverview (paste/admin-rebuild.powerfx).
   ============================================================================ */
/* NO Navigate HERE. Studio rejected it in this OnVisible ("Navigate cannot
   be used here since it would automatically always navigate away from this
   screen"), both chained in an If branch and on its own as
   If(Not (varIsAdmin Or varIsLineManager), Navigate(scrLanding)). So the
   screen does not send anyone away: its content (conContent) is Visible only
   to an admin or a line manager, everyone else sees the no-access panel with
   a Back to home button, and the data build below only runs when the check
   passes. */
Set(varIsLineManager, Not IsBlank(LookUp('RolePreference People', LineManagerEmail = varUserEmail).EmployeeID));
If(varIsAdmin Or varIsLineManager, Set(varSelectedOverviewId, Blank()); Select(btnRefreshSubs))
